# SSH Explorer

Before searching the repository, read `documentation/about.md`. Then open only the files this task changes.

`taks.txt` is a scratch list. Follow the code when it disagrees with `documentation/about.md`, then update `documentation/about.md` so the reference stays true.

- The bastion on the connect form and Connect to server are different mechanisms.
- Container file saves use the Docker writer. Host file saves use SFTP.
- Passwords are never stored in form memory.
